      {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "More Detail",
        "content": "More Detail Opportunity Type: Solicitation&nbsp; &nbsp; Solicitation Date: Apr 01, 2025 Solicitation Response Date: May 01, 2025 02:00 pm MDT Solicitation Nuemerging businessr: FA882325RB002 Set-Aside: Small Bus Set-Aside Original Set-Aside: &nbsp; NAICS: 541715 - Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences &nbsp; Place of Performance: Primary place of performance is Schriever Space Force Base (SSFB), CO. Other places of performance include Vandenberg Space Force Base (VSFB), CA; Colorado Springs, CO; with maintenance activities performed at the remote sites of Cape Canaveral Space Force Station (CCSFS), FL, Ascension Island, Diego Garcia, and Kwajalein Atoll. &nbsp;",
